---
Fix test portability across platforms.

Tests may use Linux-specific paths, APIs, or assumptions. Make them
portable to macOS and Windows.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Tests use portable path separators (or abstraction)
- [ ] No Linux-specific system calls in test code
- [ ] Test data paths resolved relative to executable or project root
- [ ] Tests pass on Linux, macOS, and Windows

## Test Plan
- [ ] Run tests on Linux, verify pass
- [ ] Run tests on macOS, verify pass
- [ ] Run tests on Windows (MinGW or MSVC), verify pass
